@WorksheetGen.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5222

### Health check
GET {{WorksheetGen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Create a valid worksheet
POST {{WorksheetGen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worksheets/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Subject": "Math",
  "Topic": "Algebra",
  "GradeLevel": "8th Grade",
  "QuestionCount": 5,
  "QuestionTypes": ["MultipleChoice",   "ShortAnswer"],
  "IncludeAnswers": true,
  "IncludePoints": true
}

### List my worksheets
GET {{WorksheetGen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worksheets

### Get one (paste an id from the POST response)
GET {{WorksheetGen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worksheets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001